#. フェンリルに関するファイル…
#. おそらく、あの棚にあったはずだ…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I believe there was a file related to Fenrir somewhere\n"
"over here..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すでに書庫を知り尽くした様子の十神クンは、
#. 真っ直ぐに奥の棚まで歩いていき…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya seemed to know the archive like the back of\n"
"his hand, and went straight to a shelf in the back.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あったぞ。これだ。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Ah, here we go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、１冊のファイルを手に戻って来た。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He quickly returned with a file in hand.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これだ…見てみろ…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Take a look at this."
msgstr ""

#. み、見てみろって言っても読めないよ…
#. これって何語…？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Umm...I have no idea what it says. What language is\n"
"this?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、高校生にもなって
#. フランス語も読めないなんて言わないよな？
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"How did you make it all the way to high school without\n"
"learning a single word of French?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…大半の高校生は読めないと思うけど…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Uh...I'm pretty sure *most* high schoolers can't speak\n"
"French..."
msgstr ""

#. …仕方ない。俺が読んでやろう。
#. ただし、この借りは１００倍にして返してもらうぞ。
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. I'll read it for you, but I expect you\n"
"to repay your debt a hundred times over."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１００倍って…破格だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A hundred times...? Isn't that kind of extreme?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルとは…
#. 中東を本拠地とする<CLT 3>戦闘のプロ集団<CLT>である。
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Fenrir is <CLT 3>an elite fighting unit<CLT> based out of the\n"
"Middle East.\""
msgstr ""

#. 民間軍事会社などとは一線を画す、
#. 直接戦闘行為に特化した、荒々しい戦闘集団だ。
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Unlike military contractors, they are a fierce group\n"
"of soldiers who engage in direct combat.\""
msgstr ""

#. 隊員１人が、一般兵１００人に相当する戦力を、
#. 保有しているとさえ言われている。
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"They claim that a single member is equivalent to an\n"
"entire company of regular soldiers.\""
msgstr ""

#. まさに<CLT 3>“終末の狼”<CLT>を意味するフェンリル同様に、
#. 戦場では、誰もが恐れる存在である。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Just like Fenrir, the <CLT 3>Wolf of Ragnarok<CLT>, their mere\n"
"presence is enough to strike fear into any enemy.\""
msgstr ""

#. 公にはされていないものの、
#. 過去に数多くの戦闘や軍事作戦に関与してきたらしい。
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"They have been involved in countless military battles\n"
"and operations, most of which are highly classified.\""
msgstr ""

#. だが、しばらく前に<CLT 3>突如として活動を停止<CLT>。
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"However, some time ago, they <CLT 3>completely ceased all\n"
"activity<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. 現在では、その存在すら確認出来ていない。
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"At present, their continued existence cannot be\n"
"confirmed.\""
msgstr ""

#. 主要メンバー全員が殺害されたとの情報もあるが、
#. 確認が取れていない為、定かではない。
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"There are unconfirmed reports that the key members of\n"
"the group were all neutralized.\""
msgstr ""

#. 各国の軍事機密を握っていた為、
#. 口封じの為に潰されたとの噂もあるが…
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Rumors indicate they were killed to keep them from\n"
"revealing the many state secrets they'd acquired.\""
msgstr ""

#. 一部では、内部紛争の結果による
#. 自滅だったとの見解もある。
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Some, however, believe there was mounting internal\n"
"tension within the group, and they simply imploded.\""
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …どうした？
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…次元が違い過ぎて……
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This all just sounds like some kind of...alternate\n"
"reality."
msgstr ""

#. 違う次元の話なんかではない…
#. これもまた現実だ。俺達の世界と地続きのな。
msgctxt "0024 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, it isn't. This is *our* reality, the *only*\n"
"reality. These people are part of our world."
msgstr ""

#. それに、戦場もここでの生活も似たようなもんだ。
#. 想像の及ばない予測不可能の世界…
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Their battlefields aren't much different from our\n"
"lives here. An unpredictable, unimaginable world..."
msgstr ""

#. …だからこそ面白いんだがな。
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's what makes it all so exciting."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>面白くなんかないよ…これっぽっちも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Exciting\" definitely isn't the word I would use...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それより、気になった事はないのか？
#. フェンリルについて知る最後の機会だぞ？
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So, did anything jump out at you? This may be your\n"
"last opportunity to learn about Fenrir."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になった事って言えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now that you mention it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nghe cậu nhắc mới nhớ...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. １つだけあるよ。
#. さっき、フェンリルの意味について言ってたよね…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The report said something about where the name Fenrir\n"
"comes from, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルの意味…<CLT 3>“終末の狼”<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's right. It said Fenrir is...the <CLT 3>Wolf of\n"
"Ragnarok<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ついでに、それと関係する事を
#. もう１つだけ教えておいてやろう…
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, would you like to know something\n"
"interesting related to that?"
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルに所属する兵士達は、
#. 自分達が、組織の一員である事を示す為に…
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To show that they're a member of the team, each\n"
"soldier that joins the squad..."
msgstr ""

#. 必ず、体のどこかに、
#. <CLT 3>フェンリルを表す刻印を刻んでいる<CLT>らしい…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...would get a <CLT 3>tattoo representing Fenrir<CLT> somewhere\n"
"on their body."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>フェンリル…終末の狼…
#. それを表す刻印…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They got a tattoo...of Fenrir...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、もしかして…！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could that mean...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>戦刃むくろのプロフィール<CLT><CLT 23>の情報を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Mukuro Ikusaba's Profile<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Bíng bong, bing bong”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 時間は…ありとあらゆる生物、物質、現象に、
#. 地味ですが確実な攻撃を浴びせ続けているのです。
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Time is utterly silent, and yet it constantly assaults\n"
"us—organisms, the earth, natural phenomena..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクらは少しずつ、着実にダメージを負っている…
#. その事をもっと自覚するべきなのです。
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It damages us little by little, until the end. You\n"
"should really think about that."
msgstr ""

#. …という訳で、時間ですよー！
#. <CLT 3>学級裁判<CLT>を始めまーす！
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Anyway! It's time to begin the <CLT 3>class trial<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、オマエラはいつもの場所に
#. さっさと集合してくださーい！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So, please meet up in the usual spot!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、また後でね～！！
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... See ya later!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら…時間のようだな…
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then the time has come..."
msgstr ""

#. ここから先は…
#. 学級裁判で明らかにするしかないって事だね…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All we can do now is try to uncover the truth during\n"
"the class trial..."
msgstr ""

#. そのようだ…行くぞ…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It would seem that way. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…十神クンの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to talk to Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…十神クンの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to talk to Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…十神クンの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to talk to Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…十神クンの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to talk to Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それよりも…十神クンの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to talk to Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい…
#. 話を聞かずに出ていく気か？
msgctxt "0053 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What, you want to leave before you hear what I have to\n"
"say?"
msgstr ""
